      "entry": {
        "function_name": "t",
        "kind": "translation",
        "line": 21212,
        "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/celestial/dirge.lua",
        "source": "Your dirges echo mournfully through the air.  When you end a dirge, you continue to gain its acolyte-level effects for %d turns.  You can only benefit from one such lingering dirge at a time.\n\nFurthermore, you are given focus by the song.  Your dirges increase your resistance to confusion and fear by %d%%.",
        "source_tag": "tformat",
        "target": "你的挽歌在周围回荡着悲伤。当你结束挽歌时，你持续获得其入门效果 %d 回合。你同时只能受到一种挽歌的余音效果。\n\n而且歌声使得你更加专注。挽歌增加你 %d%% 的混乱和恐惧抗性。",
        "args_order": null,
        "special": null,
        "logical_path": "mod-tome.lua"
      },
      "component": "tome"
    },
